    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >About the Game</h2>Heroes Survival is a game that challenges players to become the strongest heroes.<br>Collect diamonds through play to upgrade your hero and grow into a stronger hero. Play with skill and upgraded heroes to make your hero the strongest hero in the world!<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Function</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> Manual aiming mode is recommended as the default, and there is an automatic aiming option.<br></li><li> 14 heroes and skills (Red, Brian, others)<br></li><li> 90 items to choose from (rainbow, cheetah, and more)<br></li><li> Acquire diamonds to strengthen your heroes<br></li><li> You must survive each wave for 20 to 60 seconds<br></li><li> Represent your country and challenge your hero to become a top ranker.</li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >About the Game</h2>Heroes Survival is a game that challenges players to become the strongest heroes.<br>Collect diamonds through play to upgrade your hero and grow into a stronger hero. Play with skill and upgraded heroes to make your hero the strongest hero in the world!<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Function</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> Manual aiming mode is recommended as the default, and there is an automatic aiming option.<br></li><li> 14 heroes and skills (Red, Brian, others)<br></li><li> 90 items to choose from (rainbow, cheetah, and more)<br></li><li> Acquire diamonds to strengthen your heroes<br></li><li> You must survive each wave for 20 to 60 seconds<br></li><li> Represent your country and challenge your hero to become a top ranker.</li></ul>",
